WEBVTT

00:00:00.390 --> 00:00:03.804
Good morning, Leanne. We've got
Leanne here from Totoka Hair and Makeup.

00:00:03.804 --> 00:00:08.632
Good morning. Good morning. You have just
completed the 90-second Digital Wellness

00:00:08.632 --> 00:00:13.577
Reset experience. Yes, I have. Would you tell us
a little bit about how you felt and

00:00:13.577 --> 00:00:15.402
what message you got out of it?

00:00:15.402 --> 00:00:20.170
Well, it felt great. I could have sat there for
definitely a lot longer because I

00:00:20.170 --> 00:00:22.348
really enjoyed that music. I think

00:00:22.348 --> 00:00:27.686
the key message I would say is just slow down
and take the time to check things

00:00:27.686 --> 00:00:32.348
before you proceed. So yeah, that's the
main message I got out of it.

00:00:32.422 --> 00:00:37.642
Thank you, Leanne.
